{"id":"n14130-1-8","stage":3,"title":"예감 · 预感","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14130-1-8-1","ko":"너의 예감으로는 이번 시험이 어떨 것 같니?","zh":"你觉得凭你的直觉，这次考试会怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너의","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너의","audio":"/audio/7256bdfdfb5852c2a596.mp3"}},{"text":"예감으로는","meaning":"预感","explanation":"예감：预感；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예감","audio":"/audio/6cdc3048345deee5efe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14130","senseId":"1","lemma":"예감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예감으로는","audio":"/audio/ddcb6197a55f2dab4998.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"어떨","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떨","audio":"/audio/bd344c8f9584d34d3f0f.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같니?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같니","audio":"/audio/c03e9ede65fa1c7291e3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6cdc3048345deee5","term":"예감","zh":"预感","audio":"/audio/6cdc3048345deee5efe3.mp3","entryId":"14130","definition":"好像有什么事要发生的感觉。","pronunciation":["예ː감"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4d156baff86b1b32507.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14130-1-8-2","ko":"지난번 시험이 쉬웠으니까 이번엔 좀 어려울 것 같아.","zh":"上次考试很简单，所以这次应该会有点难吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번","meaning":"过，过去；次，遍","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；번：次，遍；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"},{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}},{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬웠으니까","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬웠으니까","audio":"/audio/634371f0afaca2faea39.mp3"}},{"text":"이번엔","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번엔","audio":"/audio/eae819c16fe222c8b75e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어려울","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려울","audio":"/audio/6fd95de150d3cbc62645.mp3"}},{"text":"